# daa-s console keymap for a Lenovo V15G4, based on dreymar-s colemak with extend layer (4caws)(http://colemakmods.github.io/mod-dh/)

# we wont have superl and superr participate because theyre not as ubiquitous
# shift       1 (homerow\'s leftmost)
# control     4 (homerow\'s rightmost)
# shiftl     16
# shiftr     32
# ctrll      64
# ctrlr     128
# alt         8
# altgr       2
# capsshift 256

